  "recap": "The Base Invaders put on a hitting clinic Tuesday, August 11, piling up 33 hits and cruising to a 32–15 win over The Splinters. Eleven different players reached base as the lineup turned the game into a track meet early, and three home runs punctuated the offensive onslaught. Erik led the charge going 5-for-6 with 5 RBI, while Jason matched him at 5-for-6 with 4 RBI and a home run of his own. Shane added a homer and 5 RBI on a 4-for-6 night, Scooter chipped in going 3-for-5 with 3 RBI, and Dillon made the most of a single at-bat, going 1-for-1 with a home run and 4 RBI. With offense coming from top to bottom, the Base Invaders never let The Splinters find their footing.",
